Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.50,0:23:20.05,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}話したい　ことばかりで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.50,0:23:20.05,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}怀揣满腔情思
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.05,0:23:22.67,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}時間が過ぎてゆく
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.05,0:23:22.67,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}时光缓缓流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.67,0:23:25.22,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}横たわる　この世界も
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.67,0:23:25.22,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}眼前的这片天地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:27.80,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}気づけば　暮れている
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.22,0:23:27.80,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}回过神时已是夕阳残照
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.80,0:23:29.81,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}明日も　ここで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.80,0:23:29.81,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}愿明天在此地
